<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xian-yu-bo-shi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6432694); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6432694&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608039905" alt="Xian Yu Bo Shi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6432694)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xian-yu-bo-shi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6432694); return false;">Xian Yu Bo Shi</a></span></p>
